"The meeting is playing through speakers" = "会議の音声がスピーカーから流れています";

/* Panel tip under “The meeting is playing through speakers” */
"The microphone hears the other participants too. Vauta leaves their echo out of the minutes, and headphones avoid it." = "マイクが他の参加者の声も拾っています。Vautaはそのエコーを議事録から除外します。ヘッドフォンを使うと防げます。";
